Package: reactextract
Title: Extract Reviewed REACT Study Metadata and Data
Version: 0.5.6
Authors@R: person("mathzero", email = "mathzero@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Extracts REACT-1 and REACT-2 variables from caller-managed
    Oracle connections or round files using a pinned, reviewed REACT metadata
    dictionary. Exact source values are retained; approved transforms take
    precedence and other reviewed concepts use transparent source-preserving
    coding. The same extraction interface can generate safe fictional records
    from a checksum-pinned, disclosure-controlled aggregate profile so that
    researchers can develop code outside the data enclave.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/mathzero/reactextract
BugReports: https://github.com/mathzero/reactextract/issues
